### =============================================================
### Health endpoints — full coverage HTTP test suite
### Covers liveness and readiness probes exposed by
### apps/api/internal/httpapi/health.go (mounted at the root router
### in apps/api/internal/httpapi/router.go).
### =============================================================

### Variables
@base_url = http://localhost:8080

### =============================================================
### 1. HEALTHZ (liveness)
### Endpoint: GET /healthz
### Returns 200 + JSON {status:"ok"} unconditionally — the process
### is up. Should never require auth and never touch downstreams.
### =============================================================

### 1.1 GET healthz (success)
GET {{ base_url }}/healthz

### 1.2 HEAD healthz (sanity — chi returns the same status without body)
HEAD {{ base_url }}/healthz

### 1.3 Healthz must not require auth (no Authorization header)
GET {{ base_url }}/healthz

### 1.4 Healthz ignores bogus auth (expect 200, header silently ignored)
GET {{ base_url }}/healthz
Authorization: Bearer not-a-real-token

### =============================================================
### 2. READYZ (readiness)
### Endpoint: GET /readyz
### Returns 200 when the process is ready to take traffic. Same
### shape as healthz today (Phase 2). When downstream checks land
### (Phase 6 observability), expect 503 here while degraded.
### =============================================================

### 2.1 GET readyz (success)
GET {{ base_url }}/readyz

### 2.2 HEAD readyz
HEAD {{ base_url }}/readyz

### =============================================================
### 3. METHOD / ROUTE ERRORS
### =============================================================

### 3.1 POST /healthz (expect 405 — only GET routed)
POST {{ base_url }}/healthz

### 3.2 Unknown route (expect 404)
GET {{ base_url }}/does-not-exist
